        "node_offer": {
          "text": "'Here's how it is. You can run to Garrow and be a hero. You can take a purse, forget my face, and I'll row you to Gull Rock as a favour. Or you can join the crew. Pay's better than the Guild.'",
          "startQuest": "quest_dev_smugglers",
          "choices": [
